{%- comment -%}
  Industries index — port of IndustriesPage() in pages/IndustryPages.jsx.

  Same markup React used: .ind-idx__list, one <li> per industry, each linking to
  its own guide. The guides are real Shopify pages now (created through the
  Admin API), so this is the index React had rather than an accordion standing
  in for one.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hnl_gate = section.settings.page_handle | strip -%}
{%- if hnl_gate == blank or hnl_gate == page.handle -%}
<div id="main" class="page">
  <div class="wrap ind-art ind-idx">
    <span class="ind-art__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</span>
    <h1 class="ind-art__h1">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="ind-art__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>
    <ul class="ind-idx__list">
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/clothing-garments">
          <b>Clothing &amp; Garments</b>
          <span>Hook and loop fasteners for clothing &amp; garments have always been a trusted choice of tailor, costume designer, or clothing manufacturer, as it brings in the cleanest and most suitable alternative to buttons, zips, and snaps for you.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/upholstery-furniture">
          <b>Upholstery &amp; Furniture</b>
          <span>Upholstery and furniture work are in consistent need of effective fasteners that hold firm under repeated use with no damaging effects on fabric or surfaces.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/schools-education">
          <b>Schools &amp; Education</b>
          <span>Hook and loop fasteners are used in countless creative ways within schools, child care centres and other educational institutions, including displays, learning tools, storage solutions and furniture design.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/signage-displays">
          <b>Signage &amp; Displays</b>
          <span>When it comes to signage and displays for retail spaces, events, exhibitions and commercial settings, both timing and presentation are essential.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/automotive-caravan-rv">
          <b>Automotive, Caravan &amp; RV</b>
          <span>Hook and loop fasteners are used to attach interior panels, hold accessories in place, organise storage spaces and hold loose items in place inside vehicles, caravans and RVs when traveling.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/medical-aged-care">
          <b>Medical &amp; Aged Care</b>
          <span>Hook and loop fasteners are playing a significant role in medical and aged care environments when it comes to considering features like ease of use, adjustability, and hygiene.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/warehousing-logistics">
          <b>Warehousing &amp; Logistics</b>
          <span>Organising a warehouse and logistics system efficiently and ensuring load management is secure can minimize errors, enhance safety, and accelerate daily operations.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pages/construction-industrial">
          <b>Construction &amp; Industrial</b>
          <span>Fastening solutions at construction sites and industrial facilities must be capable of performing under harsh conditions, challenging handling, dust, moisture, and heavy loads.</span>
          <em>Read guide <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HooknLoop industries",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "page_handle", "label": "Only show on page handle", "info": "Leave empty to show on every page using this template." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Industries & applications" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Hook & loop, matched to your industry" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "Practical fastening guides for the trades and sectors we supply — the right product, the right width, and how it's used, for each application." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "HooknLoop industries" }]
}
{% endschema %}
